<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Oil costs exceed proceeds.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Oil costs exceed proceeds.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Oil and Gas Royalty Trust said Tuesday Class A costs for the month of May exceeded Gross Proceeds by $235,065 increasing the cumulative Class A cost carry-forward of $6,104,418.</p>
<p>Accordingly, there will be no distribution for the month, the trust said. It last made a distribution in October 1995.</p>
<p>In addition, the trust said, net current month trust administrative expenses of $13,162 were paid from the trust administrative expense reserve resulting in $1.9 million remaining in the expense reserve.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
